{"4718130":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Lagrange Front Idle","steam_appid":4718130,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/8ca062c2c20222fc511969b5f2b6366e.poster.avif?t=1793725146\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/8ca062c2c20222fc511969b5f2b6366e.webm?t=1793725146\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/8ca062c2c20222fc511969b5f2b6366e.mp4?t=1793725146\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/801b78f40acd9d275d565afe32a139b9.avif?t=1793725146\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span> <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle<\/strong>: Watch as the factions fight over territory only involving yourself as much as you care. Your units will consume everything... eventually.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard<\/strong>: A mix between idle and hardcore interaction can help alleviate stalemates and speed up gaining control.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore<\/strong>: You are an active leader bombarding the enemies into oblivion as your sectors are being ravaged by the enemy factions. There is no idling here, you are the commander everyone looks up to.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/65cbe98e8b1173f0b1cf349b3652973a.poster.avif?t=1793725146\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/65cbe98e8b1173f0b1cf349b3652973a.webm?t=1793725146\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/65cbe98e8b1173f0b1cf349b3652973a.mp4?t=1793725146\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/1a446ad95c5b7d6555d84e2047477b9e.avif?t=1793725146\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbital Lance<\/strong>: the radar becomes a beam that tears through enemies<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Well<\/strong>: create an artificial black hole to consume your enemies<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arc Relay<\/strong>: lightning rips through enemies in proximity<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sensor Flood<\/strong>: highlight every enemy and increase the damage to them<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armada Call<\/strong>: call in the heavy cruisers to unload a salvo on unfortunate foes<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/920c15a31982bb06991031c495cb07a6.poster.avif?t=1793725146\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/920c15a31982bb06991031c495cb07a6.webm?t=1793725146\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/920c15a31982bb06991031c495cb07a6.mp4?t=1793725146\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/8d79dbe4b5e212ec4b4d76ca1d44ab5d.avif?t=1793725146\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your forces from a mere few to thousands. The spectacle grows as your empire expands! Three way faction fights bring the best (and worst) together as anyone can end up as the captor. Be wary though, as the scale of the empire expands, so do the dangers of the universe... Blackholes, higher entities, exploding stars....<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/80ad38607f6bbb5b4c41ba358f1ea91d.poster.avif?t=1793725146\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/80ad38607f6bbb5b4c41ba358f1ea91d.webm?t=1793725146\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/80ad38607f6bbb5b4c41ba358f1ea91d.mp4?t=1793725146\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/7296ed970d205012168ba45f3c3222ca.avif?t=1793725146\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every last capture of a sector leads to a grander scale<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sol System, from Mercury to the Oort Cloud<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Solar Neighbourhood<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Milky Way<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Local Group, Laniakea and the Observable Universe<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then to the procedural multi-verse<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/524904f8bb2a38151efba44590f2df37.poster.avif?t=1793725146\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/524904f8bb2a38151efba44590f2df37.webm?t=1793725146\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/524904f8bb2a38151efba44590f2df37.mp4?t=1793725146\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/61caabec7426c4f653a223b9abee1007.avif?t=1793725146\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doctrines:<\/strong> pick your permanent upgrade and leave the other to the void<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inhabited worlds:<\/strong> decide the fate of the worlds you come across and the outcomes they bring<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/a993b186338680dac6328d8420195000.avif?t=1793725146\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4718130\/extras\/8ca062c2c20222fc511969b5f2b6366e.poster.avif?t=1793725146\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.co